<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">Valor Points for Restoration Shaman Healer in Phase 4</h3>Normal mode tier tokens are no longer acquirable with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> due to the introduction of LFR items on Dragon Soul, thus Valor can be more freely spent on best in slot pieces such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77096/woundlicker-cover">
<img alt="Woundlicker Cover" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Woundlicker Cover</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77082/mindbender-lens">
