<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Chest for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>The best chest option available is the Elemental tier chest <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78818/spiritwalkers-hauberk">
<img alt="Spiritwalker's Hauberk" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidshaman_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spiritwalker's Hauberk</span></a> which also starts you on the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> Tier set bonuses! Alternatively, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77125/ghostworld-chestguard">
<img alt="Ghostworld Chestguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidshaman_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ghostworld Chestguard</span></a> has strong stats but lacks the set bonus contribution.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
