<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Hands for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>The best hands option available are the tier hands <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78767/spiritwalkers-handwraps">
<img alt="Spiritwalker's Handwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_mail_raidshaman_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spiritwalker's Handwraps</span></a>, and the Valor hands <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77163/gloves-of-ghostly-dreams">
<img alt="Gloves of Ghostly Dreams" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_mail_raidshaman_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of Ghostly Dreams</span></a> also being good.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74198/enchant-gloves-haste">
