<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Waist for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>The best waist option available is the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78468/belt-of-shattered-elementium">
<img alt="Belt of Shattered Elementium" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidshaman_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Shattered Elementium</span></a> from the new hard mode dungeons, but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77183/girdle-of-shamanic-fury">
