<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Rings for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77109/band-of-reconstruction">
<img alt="Band of Reconstruction" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ring_generic_1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Reconstruction</span></a> is the best option along with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78496/signet-of-suturing">
