<img alt="Soothing Brimstone Circle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_firelandsraid_02c.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soothing Brimstone Circle</span></a> being weaker but still viable options.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74217/enchant-ring-intellect">
