<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Trinkets for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77976/heart-of-unliving">
<img alt="Heart of Unliving" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_qirajicrystal_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Unliving</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77975/will-of-unbinding">
<img alt="Will of Unbinding" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Will of Unbinding</span></a> are the best trinkets for Restoration as long as you are using a <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=8050/flame-shock">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_flameshock.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flame Shock</span></a> to activate <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=77796/focused-insight">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shaman_measuredinsight.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Focused Insight</span></a> for every Healing Rain. If you do not want to use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=77796/focused-insight">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shaman_measuredinsight.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Focused Insight</span></a>, equip <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77981/windward-heart">
<img alt="Windward Heart" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_elemental_crystal_air.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Windward Heart</span></a> instead.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65124/fall-of-mortality">
<img alt="Fall of Mortality" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cat_trinket12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fall of Mortality</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62050/darkmoon-card-tsunami">
<img alt="Darkmoon Card: Tsunami" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarot_tsunamicard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Tsunami</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64645/tyrandes-favorite-doll">
<img alt="Tyrande's Favorite Doll" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_tyrandesfavoritedoll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tyrande's Favorite Doll</span></a> are the best trinkets available, as the extra Spirit from Tsunami counts towards <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=16190/mana-tide-totem">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_summonwaterelemental.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mana Tide Totem</span></a> for a massive Mana boost to your whole raid.<div class="pad"></div>
