<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hands-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Off Hands for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>While you can also use off-hands, we recommend using shields as the competition is lower and you will get free armor along with the usual throughput stats. You can get the best shield, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78458/timepiece-of-the-bronze-flight">
<img alt="Timepiece of the Bronze Flight" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timepiece of the Bronze Flight</span></a>, easily from doing the new hard mode dungeons.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Off-Hand Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74235/enchant-off-hand-superior-intellect">
